# Skill Port - Cursor Rule

Use this rule when the user asks to import or convert skills from Claude Code (`.claude/skills`), Antigravity (`.agents/skills`), or OpenAI into Cursor IDE rules.

## Instructions
1. Extract the instructions and triggers from the source skill.
2. Create or update `.cursor/rules/<skill-name>.mdc` with frontmatter:
   - `description`: The trigger conditions and purpose of the rule.
   - `globs`: Applicable file globs (or `*`).
   - `alwaysApply`: false (or true if always active).
3. Transpile vendor-specific instructions into standard IDE editing directives.

